abstract: >-
  pqcp-zephyr-trust-stack is an out-of-tree Zephyr RTOS module providing
  ML-KEM (FIPS 203) and ML-DSA (FIPS 204) primitives through a layered
  PSA Crypto + mbedTLS provider surface, with an ACVP serial validation
  harness, vendored NIST ACVP Known-Answer-Test fixtures, a
  cost-of-assurance regression suite, MCU resource-budget enforcement,
  sanitizer coverage, and a benchmark provenance sidecar. Each release
  produces a replay-checkable Assurance Ledger that binds every
  release-relevant claim to specific evidence artifacts with recorded
  SHA-256 hashes; the same evidence pack can be re-verified later by a
  reviewer with only Python 3.12, no Zephyr SDK.
